        <mxCell id="ws1" value="WS1: EXECUTIVE KPI SUMMARY&#xa;─────────────────────&#xa;📌 4 KPI Cards (side-by-side)&#xa;📊 Measures: Total Claims, Total Cost&#xa;   Approval Rate, Avg Cost/Claim&#xa;⏱️ Build Time: 25 min | Complexity: ⭐&#xa;📍 Position: Row 1 - Full Width" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
